OL,3,GNEWSAStaff at displaced school set for
OL,4,Aanother strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a displaced school are set to
OL,7,Fstrike for a second time over a
OL,8,Fworkload dispute.
OL,10,FSacred Heart Catholic Primary in
OL,11,FBarrow, Cumbria, has been operating
OL,12,Ffrom temporary classrooms and other
OL,13,Fschools since January 2023, when a
OL,14,Froutine inspection found the floor was
OL,15,Frotten and at risk of collapse.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
