OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStaff at displaced school set for
OL,4,Aanother strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the National Association of
OL,7,FHead Teachers (NAHT) claimed staff had
OL,8,Fnot been properly recognised and
OL,9,Fcompensated for "for the exceptional
OL,10,Fadditional duties, responsibilities and
OL,11,Fexcessive hours worked" following the
OL,12,Femergency evacuation. They plan to
OL,13,Fstrike on Monday and Tuesday.
OL,15,FMater Christi Trust, which runs the
OL,16,Fschool, has been approached for
OL,17,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
